    "created_at": "2017-04-12T17:07:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-12T17:07:59Z",
    "body": "Right, that's a sensible argument. It breaks compatibility with anyone currently using `gattserverdisconnected`, but we can fire both for a transition period.\r\n\r\n@rbyers, do you have a sense of the right thing to do here? We probably shipped the wrong spelling of this event, but no other browsers have complained yet.",
